## CatalogReportsApi

### Build catalogs report
## Build catalogs report
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/reports?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 
}


### Get catalogs report
## Get catalogs report
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/reports?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&token={{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List report stats
## List report stats
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/catalogs/reports/stats?adAccountId={{adAccountId}}&parameters={{parameters}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json
